  lore:
  - id: quiet-copy/0
    title: The missing appendix
    company: HELIX DYNAMICS
    contract: The Quiet Copy
    text: 'HELIX / INTERNAL REVIEW: The prototype passes every efficiency benchmark. Publication remains suspended until the licensing team establishes which improvements can be removed from the public submission.'
  - id: quiet-copy/1
    title: Lab notebook, 03:17
    company: HELIX DYNAMICS
    contract: The Quiet Copy
    text: 'Lark''s lab notes: We built the first working cell from scavenged parts. The technician who fixed the cooling loop still takes two buses home. Management says affordable energy would disrupt our market position.'
  - id: quiet-copy/2
    title: A public promise
    company: HELIX DYNAMICS
    contract: The Quiet Copy
    text: 'Draft press release: Energy belongs to everyone. Revision note: Legal requests replacement of ''everyone'' with ''approved commercial partners''. The original author declined to initial the change.'
